<br/>
As a result, a reduction from five to four GPU cores in the &zwnj;iPhone 18&zwnj; could be among the planned downgrades. Fixed Focus Digital added that it is "highly probable" that Apple will tweak the name of the device's A-series chip in an effort to disguise the extent of downgrade. <br/>
